  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5605.06 Court Orders",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5605.06 Court Orders. \"An order of a court or agency\", pursuant to RSA 260:14, V(a)(2), shall be construed to mean orders other than an order to disclose as provided in RSA 260:14, III, and shall be construed to mean orders such as but not limited to:\n\n(1) Entries of judgment;\n\n(2) Support orders; or\n\n(3) Writs of service endorsed by the court.\n\nSource. #7361, EXEMPT, eff 9-1-00; ss by #7621, EXEMPT, eff 1-1-02",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c5600.html"
}
